  "reference": "Ogokora Kw’abatomwa 13",
  "copyright": "© 2021 KENBS",
  "verseCount": 52,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "13",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ACT 13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "13",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ekanisa ya Antiokia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ekanisa ya Abantiokia mbarengeo ababani amo aborokia: Barnaba na Simioni, oyo ore korokwa Nigeri, na Lukio Omokurene, na Manaeni oyo orereretwe amo nomorwoti Herode, na Saulo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba iga, ekero barenge gosasiima Omonene, na kweng’ata, Omoika Omochenu agateeba: “Nchorere Barnaba na Saulo ase emeremo eria nabarangereretie bayekore.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio kobakoorire okweng’ata na ogosaba bakababeekera amaboko, bakabatiga bagende.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Barnaba na Saulo ase Kuporo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abwo babere bagatomwa n’Omoika Omochenu, bagatirimboka gochia Selukia, na korwa agwo bakaamboka n’emeeri gochia Kuporo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bagaika Salami, bakarandia ring’ana ria Nyasae ase chisinagogi chi’Abayahudi, na barabwo nigo barenge na Yohana okobakonya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero bakoorire goeta gati‐gati y’egesinka gionsi goika Pafo, bakanyora aroro omonto oyomo Omoyahudi omoriingoria, omobani bw’oborimo, ore korokwa Bar-Yeso.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonto oyio nigo arenge amo na gabana Sergio Paulo, omonto bw’obong’aini. Ere akarangeria Barnaba na Saulo bache asare, akarigia koigwa ring’ana ria Nyasae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende Elima, oria omoringoria (okoonchorwa kw’erieta riaye nakwo oko) akaamererania nabarabwo, akarigia koonchora gabana oria atige okwegena.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende Saulo, oyokorokwa naende Paulo, agaichorwa n’Omoika Omochenu, akamotogoreria amaiso, akabora,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aye omwana o Saitani omobisa bw’oboronge bwonsi, oichire nobong’ainereria n’obobe bwonsi, torigeti gotiga gokora bogeka chinchera chia Nyasae Omobui chire boronge?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rora bono, okoboko kw’Omonene nigo kore igoro ase ore, aye nobe omouko, torora erioba ase engaki.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Erio kegima akabwatwa norotutu na omosunte, agataba‐taba akarigia abanto bamobwate okoboko bamoraae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero gabana achia korora ayakoreka, akeegena, agakumia ase okworokereria kw’Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ase Antiokia ya Pisidia. Okorandia gwa Paulo ase Abayahudi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Paulo na abamwabo bakamanora n’emeeri korwa Pafo, bagaika Perga ase Pamfulia. Yohana akabatiga, akairana Yerusalemu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "korende barabwo bakarua Perga, bakagenda Antiokia, omochie o Pisidia. Rituko ria Esabato bagasoa ase esinagogi, bagaikaransa aroro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magega kabasomire amachiiko na egetabu y’ababani, abatang’ani b’esinagogi bagatoma amang’ana ase bare kobateebia: “Abaminto, onye more ne ring’ana ri’okoremia, rikwane!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo agatenena, akarambora okoboko, agakwana: Inwe abasacha b’Abaisraeli, na inwe abamoirogete Nyasae, ntegerera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyasae bw’abaanto aba Abaisraeli agachora chisokoro chiaito, na ekero barabwo bamenyete buna abamenyi ase ense ya Misiri, akabaimokereria igoro. Ase okobua kwaye akabarusia aroro,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na koreng’ana engaki y’emiaka emerongo ene akaremereria nabarabwo ase erooro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agasiria ebisaku bitano na bibere ase ense ya Kaanani, na ense yabo akabaa ebe omwando obo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "koreng’ana engaki y’emiaka amagana ane, na emerongo etano. Magega y’ayio akabaa abagaambi goika ekero ki’omobani Samweli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio magega yaye bagasaba baegwe omorwoti. Nyasae akabaa Saulo, mosinto o Kishi, omonto bw’ororeria rwa Benjamini, oyio obagamberete engaki y’emiaka emerongo ene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero konya amorusirie oyo, akaimokereria Daudi igoro koba omorwoti obo. Akabateebia igoro yaye: Nanyorire Daudi, mosinto o Yese; nere omonto ongweneire ase enkoro yane, naende nere oraanyare gokora ogwancha kwane gwonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korwa ase oroiboro rw’omonto oyio Nyasae orenteire Abaisraeli Omotooria, nere Yeso. Nabo abarierete eira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ritang’ani ere ataraacha, Yohana konya obarandeirie abanto bonsi ba Israeli ebatiso y’okoonchoka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Yohana abeire ang’e gokoora orogendo rwaye akabora, Nigo mokagete ng’a ninche ng’o? Inche tari Kristo. Korende magega yane ngocha are oyomo, ere oyo inche ntaisaini gosibora chinuga ch’ebikoroto bi’amagoro aye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaminto, abanto b’ororeria rwa Aburaamu, amo nabande ase more inwe abamoirogete Nyasae, ring’ana ri’ogotooreka riatomirwe ase tore.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naki abamenyete Yerusalemu, na abanene babo tibamomanyete, ekiagera tibamanyete nonya namang’ana y’ababani. Ase okomogambia baikeranirie ayare gosomwa ase chibuku chi’ababani kera Esabato.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nonya tibanyorete engencho y’okomoita, bagasaba Pilato aitwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero bachia goikerania onsi ayariikire igoro yaye, bakamoikia korwa ase omote, bakamobeka ase oboina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende Nyasae akamobokia korwa ase abakuure.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase amatuko amange akarorekana ase abwo barenge gotiira komo korwa Galili goika Yerusalemu. Bono barabwo kirori baye bare ase abanto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na intwe twabarenteire amang’ana amaya aria Nyasae arierete chisokoro chiaito eira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya Nyasae atoikeraneirie intwe abana babo ase okobokia Yeso. Naende buna ariikire ase Zaburi ibere:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aye naye Omwana one, reero nakoiboire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende ng’a nigo amobogetie korwa ase abakuure, erinde tanyara koirana naende ase ogosareka, okwanire iga,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nimbae ogosesenigwa ogochenu na ogw’ekeene,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "koria narierete Daudi eira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio okwanire naende ase Zaburi ende,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Togotiga Omochenu oo arore ogosareka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naki Daudi, ekero akoorire gokorera ogwancha kwa Nyasae ase ekegori kiaye, agakwa, agatindekwa ase chisokoro chiaye chiatindegetwe, akarora ogosareka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende oyo obogetigwe na Nyasae taroche ogosareka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio baminto, tiga amanyekane ase more ng’a goetera ase oyio nigo mokoranderigwa okwaberwa kw’ebibe,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na asere kera oyomwegenire nigo akobarerwa oboronge ase amang’ana aria atakonyarekana kobarerwa oboronge ase amachiiko a Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaki, erende, tabaisa kobaikera amang’ana aria akwanetwe nababani:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rigereria, inwe abachaayi, mokumie na mosire,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ekiagera ngochia gokora ’nde ring’ana ase amatuko aino,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "eri motegene nonya ’monto onde bwensi naisa kobateebia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabasokire, abanto bakabasorora bache kobateebia amang’ana aya Esabato ya kabere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero omosangererekano bw’esinagogi oera, Abayahudi abange na abegeni b’ebisaku binde abaonchogete bakabwatana na Paulo na Barnaba, abakwanete nabarabwo, na kobaremia bagenderere ase obuya bwa Nyasae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abatomwa bakogenda ase abanto b’Ebisaku",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase Esabato ya kabere abanto abange, ang’e omochie bwonsi, bagasangererekana baigwe ring’ana ria Nyasae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende ekero Abayahudi bachia korora emeganda, bagaichorwa ne ribero, bagakaana amang’ana ayare gokwanwa na Paulo, bakamorama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo na Barnaba bagakwana noboremu, bagateeba: Igo yagwenerete ng’a ring’ana ria Nyasae rikwanwe ase more ritang’ani. Korende ekiagera mwarisukeirie are mwenacheire inwe abanyene ng’a timogwenereti obogima bwa kare na kare, tweonchoreire abanto b’Ebisaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo twachigetwe n’Omonene,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nakobekire obe omobaso ase abanto b’Ebisaku,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "erinde ogotooreka kwane kogende,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "goike ase chinsinyo chi’ense.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero abanto b’Ebisaku bachia koigwa ayio bakagoka, bagatogia ring’ana ri’Omonene, na abwo bachiikeretwe konyora obogima bwa kare na kare bakeegena.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ring’ana ri’Omonene rikaranda ase ense eria yonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abayahudi bakaburukania abakungu abamoirogete Nyasae, abasikire n’abanto, na abanene b’omochie, bakagenka abanto bachande Paulo na Barnaba, na kobaseria korwa ensemo yabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende Paulo na Barnaba bakabakong’ontera orotu rw’amagoro abo, bakagenda Ikonio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na aborokigwa bagaichorwa nomogooko na Omoika Omochenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.52"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
